Databricks Apps hosting: uvicorn with standard async worker pool
Vector Search endpoint: Dedicated endpoint (contract_intelligence_vs_endpoint) handles embedding similarity at scale
Foundation Model API: Databricks-managed, auto-scaled LLM inference
Bottlenecks
FMAPI rate limits: Claude Sonnet calls are the primary latency contributor (2–4s per call, 3–6 calls per query)
ReAct loop serialization: Steps are sequential by design (each step depends on previous observation)
Legacy Branch A: Clause existence scans all 306 providers — inherently expensive ($5.50, 8–12s)
